<%--
Record_Table - compact record list table with optional whole-row navigation

default content - the authored <thead> / <tbody>. Give a row a
    <tr data-href="/url"> to make the WHOLE row navigate; clicks on real
    interactive elements inside it (a, button, input, select, label) are
    respected and do NOT trigger row navigation.

The single shared record-list look. Place inside a <Section $flush=true> so the
table sits edge-to-edge (R2 - the section owns the flush, the table never
cancels padding from inside).

Usage:
    <Section $title="Projects" $count=_count $flush=true>
        <Slot:body>
            <Record_Table>
                <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr data-href="<%= Rsx.Route('Projects_View_Action', _p.id) %>">
                        <td><%= _p.name %></td>
                        <td><Status_Badge $label=_p.status__label $badge=_p.status__badge /></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </Record_Table>
        </Slot:body>
    </Section>
--%>
<Define:Record_Table tag="table" class="table">
    <%= content() %>
</Define:Record_Table>
